App icon ic_kotatsu_notes: Kotatsu's own drawing (K and open book) inside the
shared tile frame. The frame path matches ic_calculator_icon.xml in Mudita's
Kompakt Calculator (https://github.com/mudita/MuditaOS-K-Calculator-opensource).
The upstream README states: "This project is licensed under GPLv3".

Checkbox: independently drawn primitive shapes, following Kotatsu's monochrome
style and the measured Mudita Notes presentation. No Mudita Notes source or
resources are included.

